# Machine-local settings, created once and never overwritten or committed.
# The place for work settings and anything else that must stay off GitHub.
#
# Sourced last, after Oh My Zsh and after the aliases, so anything here wins.
# The one thing that cannot go here is config Oh My Zsh reads as it loads --
# plugins, ZSH_THEME, zstyle. Those are already set in the template that
# generates ~/.zshrc, behind an OS guard where they differ by platform.
#
# For settings worth syncing to another machine, use the tracked per-host file
# at ~/.config/zsh/hosts/ instead.
